    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>pixel art 2D platformer</strong>, you will help Rem\u00a0collect all of her records as her stats and abilitities are constantly being remixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persist through each level over and over again while your speed, abilities, time limit, scenery, and more constantly change around you. Victory only comes when you have mastered each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Rem</strong>, who holds the world's biggest record collection, but she somehow lost <i>ALL</i> of them! She goes off on a quest throughout her Cyber City to reclaim all of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/37442276c3dbfbb0fd075a6b07f14744.poster.avif?t=1747960341\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/37442276c3dbfbb0fd075a6b07f14744.apng?t=1747960341\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over<strong> 5</strong>\u00a0<strong>unique areas</strong> and talk with strange people to find out where all the records went, and how they were lost in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/0c362fa651187b9cabd6fc5dbc47ce1f.avif?t=1747960341\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong><i>dangeous foes</i></strong> who may have deeper reasons to be stopping you from retrieving all of the records...</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>pixel art 2D platformer</strong>, you will help Rem\u00a0collect all of her records as her stats and abilitities are constantly being remixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persist through each level over and over again while your speed, abilities, time limit, scenery, and more constantly change around you. Victory only comes when you have mastered each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Rem</strong>, who holds the world's biggest record collection, but she somehow lost <i>ALL</i> of them! She goes off on a quest throughout her Cyber City to reclaim all of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/37442276c3dbfbb0fd075a6b07f14744.poster.avif?t=1747960341\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/37442276c3dbfbb0fd075a6b07f14744.apng?t=1747960341\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over<strong> 5</strong>\u00a0<strong>unique areas</strong> and talk with strange people to find out where all the records went, and how they were lost in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450190/extras/0c362fa651187b9cabd6fc5dbc47ce1f.avif?t=1747960341\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong><i>dangeous foes</i></strong> who may have deeper reasons to be stopping you from retrieving all of the records...</p></li></ul>",
